        "y0": 0.3036236589954746,
        "x1": 0.4615095258891832,
        "y1": 0.33709677829537343
      },
      "text": "Shamanism and Eco-cosmology -",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5210946422708845,
        "y0": 0.3217716950883148,
        "x1": 0.9060590360518963,
        "y1": 0.33709677829537343
      },
      "text": "analogous communities are deprived of their fundamental human rights for secured",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5210946422708845,
        "y0": 0.33951362647036076,
        "x1": 0.880143308041441,
        "y1": 0.3548387096774194
      },
      "text": "livelihood and preserved ecosystems. An industrial neo-colonial intrusion into",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1294184709764261,
        "y0": 0.3431397695695201,
        "x1": 0.43505093571986597,
        "y1": 0.3766128888694189
      },
      "text": "A cross-cultural perspective",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5210946422708845,
        "y0": 0.3572555578524067,
        "x1": 0.9063175539243634,
        "y1": 0.3725806410594653
      },
      "text": "mineral rich territories of indigenous and analogous peoples takes place worldwide.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5210946422708845,
        "y0": 0.37499748923445264,
        "x1": 0.8960552788288229,
        "y1": 0.39032257244151125
      },
      "text": "With the ecological degradation, vulnerable worldviews of indigenous/ analogous",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.217787914065887,
        "y0": 0.40040070683725426,
        "x1": 0.3466629701075741,
        "y1": 0.41572579004431287
      },
      "text": "Organised & Conceptualised",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5210946422708845,
        "y0": 0.3927394206164986,
        "x1": 0.7731932462824928,
        "y1": 0.4080645038235573
      },
      "text": "communities and their rituals are critically threatened.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2765108360078842,
        "y0": 0.4181426382193002,
        "x1": 0.2879575738794493,
        "y1": 0.4334677214263588
      },
      "text": "by",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5210946422708845,
        "y0": 0.4104813519985445,
        "x1": 0.9017564461105272,
        "y1": 0.42580643520560324
      },
      "text": "These worldviews and local knowledge systems however could be a key for finding",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.16733181879847553,
        "y0": 0.43588456960134614,
        "x1": 0.3970627184831249,
        "y1": 0.45120965280840475
      },
      "text": "Stefano Beggiora, Ca’Foscari University, Venice",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5210946422708845,
        "y0": 0.42822328338059046,
        "x1": 0.9094533336701751,
        "y1": 0.4435483665876492
      },
      "text": "local and global solutions for a sustainable and philanthropic global world of cultural",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.18415050513841316,
        "y0": 0.45362655225620474,
        "x1": 0.3804396423084661,
        "y1": 0.46895163546326346
      },
      "text": "Diana Riboli, Panteio University, Athens",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5210946422708845,
        "y0": 0.4459652147626364,
        "x1": 0.7178909377152818,
        "y1": 0.4612902979696951
      },
      "text": "and eco-biological diversity and mutuality.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12115165336374002,
        "y0": 0.4713684836382508,
        "x1": 0.4456561765304676,
        "y1": 0.4866935668453094
      },
      "text": "Lidia Guzy, Marginalised & Endangered Worldviews Study Centre,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.21037627698259634,
        "y0": 0.48911041502029673,
        "x1": 0.35419036389665887,
        "y1": 0.5044354982273553
      },
      "text": "University College Cork, Cork",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5210946422708845,
        "y0": 0.48144912879954105,
        "x1": 0.8974806068968474,
        "y1": 0.49677421200659966
      },
      "text": "The 2-days workshop discusses from anthropological, environmental and study of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
