        "x1": 0.39987560462154215,
        "y1": 0.5221774296094013
      },
      "text": "Davide Torri, Heidelberg University, Heidelberg",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5210946422708845,
        "y0": 0.4987877995096227,
        "x1": 0.881032679118117,
        "y1": 0.5141128827166814
      },
      "text": "religions perspective local eco-cosmological shamanic knowledge systems and",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5210946422708845,
        "y0": 0.5165297308916688,
        "x1": 0.8903540390519216,
        "y1": 0.5318548140987274
      },
      "text": "worldviews. It aims on the one hand at displaying the threatened local ecological",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5210946422708845,
        "y0": 0.5342717135465274,
        "x1": 0.8812320409098401,
        "y1": 0.549596796753586
      },
      "text": "knowledge transmitted by shamans; on the other hand the workshop aims at a",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5210946422708845,
        "y0": 0.5520136449285733,
        "x1": 0.9003311180425025,
        "y1": 0.5673387281356319
      },
